   "html": "<div class=\"cluster-overview\">\n<p class=\"lead\">Das AUTOSAR Operating System ist ein statisch konfiguriertes, echtzeitfähiges preemptives Betriebssystem nach OSEK/VDX mit Tasks, Events, Alarmen, Schedule-Tables und Speicherschutz.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sect\">Module im Cluster</h2>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/os.html\">\n    <h3>AUTOSAR OS</h3>\n    <p>Real-time operating system managing priority-based preemptive task scheduling, events, alarms, and schedule tables (OSEK/VDX derivative).</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 1</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">79 APIs (48 Funktionen, 31 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;Os.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>",
